<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_figure"><span id="A10.F23.4" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Figure A23</span>: </span><span id="A10.F23.5" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold" style="font-size:90%;">Additional qualitative results of our method on Shikra-7B with PAI.<span id="A10.F23.5.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_medium"> On the POPE dataset, our method correctly identifies objects present in the image. Correct and incorrect answers are highlighted in blue and red, respectively.</span></span></figcaption>
